        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054980/extras/b0cf57d94686a745ac46af37cb16aedb.avif?t=1763256549\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somethin isn't right. Whispers linger in the quiet, and the air feels heavier that it should. Beware, that what comes to light may not willingly return to the darkness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each descent is a gamble. No second chances, The path ahead is treacherous and ever-changing. You may seek to save yourself, perhaps even others. But beware, the deeper you delve, the greater the risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break the curse, or find your Sepulcher within!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Souls-inspired, Permadeath, Roguelike dungeon crawler, where every room is filled with the swarming Undead, and every run is a new layout. Fight for your life as the only goal is to break the curse at the bottom of this accursed land, or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054980/extras/7078670121490122340f642da1505afb.avif?t=1763256549\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054980/extras/7321445e3d9df5170c59765eb6c3231b.avif?t=1763256549\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054980/extras/910b84973ac7dc80d1b21eac10870dad.avif?t=1763256549\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054980/extras/68081c738dda8d7e13894533cf185045.avif?t=1763256549\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054980/extras/038c829311f8271e6a447aafda788562.avif?t=1763256549\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
